---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for CG Lumberjack's private SMS notifications.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p><em>Last updated: October 19, 2026</em></p>
    <p>
      This policy covers the text-message (SMS) notifications sent by <strong>CG Lumberjack</strong>
      ("we", "us"), a sole proprietorship operated by Tom Mikota. These notifications are a private,
      non-commercial service for one household: the account owner and immediate family members who have
      personally asked to receive them.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      The only personal information we hold for this service is the mobile phone number of each recipient
      and the content of the messages we send them. Numbers are entered by the account owner into a private
      configuration and are provided by the recipients themselves.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>
      We use phone numbers only to deliver the alerts the recipient asked for, such as school-related
      reminders and upcoming event or deadline notices. We send no marketing or promotional messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell or share your SMS opt-in data or personal information with third parties for marketing
      purposes. Your number and message content are shared only with the service providers needed to deliver
      the messages (our messaging provider and your mobile carrier), and only for that purpose.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention and your choices</h2>
    <p>
      We keep a recipient's number only while they want to receive messages. Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to
      any message to opt out at any time, or contact us to have your number removed.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>CG Lumberjack, c/o Tom Mikota: tmikota@gmail.com</p>
  </div>
</Base>
